"""Single Line Diagram (SLD) blueprint.

Ports the standalone http.server at
dev_capture_process_from_drawn/single_line_diagram/serve.py into a Flask
blueprint that lives inside the production EL dashboard app and shares
QR_codes.db (env var DB_PATH) with the rest of the app.

Routes (all require login):
    GET    /sld/api/buildings
    GET    /sld/api/assets[?building=<code>&history=<bool>]
    POST   /sld/api/assets
    PUT    /sld/api/assets/<row_id>
    DELETE /sld/api/assets/<row_id>
    POST   /sld/api/upload           multipart PDF upload
    POST   /sld/api/process          runs extract_electrical_schema.py

Config (read from current_app.config):
    DB_PATH              path to QR_codes.db (shared with main app)
    SLD_PDF_STORAGE      directory for uploaded PDFs
    SLD_EXTRACT_SCRIPT   path to extract_electrical_schema.py
    SLD_EXTRACT_TIMEOUT  seconds (default 600)
"""

